{10007}{Greetings!  It's a great pleasure to make your acquaintance...}{Greetings!  It's a great pleasure to make your acquaintance...}{}{1}{}{ }
{10008}{Hello!  How can I help you...?}{Hello!  How can I help you...?}{}{2}{}{ }
{10009}{Greetings, stranger.  What is it you need?}{Greetings, stranger.  What is it you need?}{}{3}{}{ }
{10010}{Ah!  It's wonderful to see you again!}{Ah!  It's wonderful to see you again!}{}{4}{}{ }
{10011}{Hello again!  It's so very good to see you...}{Hello again!  It's so very good to see you...}{}{5}{}{ }
{10012}{Ah yes.  You again.  How can I help you?}{Ah yes.  You again.  How can I help you?}{}{6}{}{ }
{10013}{May I offer you my healing skill?}{May I offer you my healing skill?}{}{7}{}{ }
{10014}{I'm finished, now...}{I'm finished, now...}{}{8}{}{ }
{10015}{We elves are fairly open-minded, but manners are manners.  Try to cover yourself next time...}{We elves are fairly open-minded, but manners are manners.  Try to cover yourself next time...}{}{9}{}{ }
{10016}{A barbarian in the trees of Qintarra?  There's a sight we don't see everyday...}{A barbarian in the trees of Qintarra?  There's a sight we don't see everyday...}{}{10}{}{ }
{10017}{Greetings.  We elves are used to the ways of magic...your companions will surprise no one here...}{Greetings.  We elves are used to the ways of magic...your companions will surprise no one here...}{}{11}{}{ }
{10018}{Do you think such an appearance will get a reaction here?  The elves of Qintarra have seen it all, I'm afraid...}{Do you think such an appearance will get a reaction here?  The elves of Qintarra have seen it all, I'm afraid...}{}{12}{}{ }
{10019}{Looks like you've been playing with magick...[Suppressing a laugh.] And you're not doing so well...}{Looks like you've been playing with magick...[Suppressing a laugh.] And you're not doing so well...}{}{13}{}{ }
{10021}{The elves of Qintarra are used to magick, but we also don't like to be tricked.  Show yourself next time, please...}{The elves of Qintarra are used to magick, but we also don't like to be tricked.  Show yourself next time, please...}{}{14}{}{ }
{11000}{You're a disgrace.}{You're a disgrace.}{}{15}{}{ }
{11001}{You're bothering me.  What do you want?}{You're bothering me.  What do you want?}{}{16}{}{ }
{11002}{What?  What do you want}{What?  What do you want}{}{17}{}{ }
{11003}{Again?  What do you want now?}{Again?  What do you want now?}{}{18}{}{ }
{11004}{Perhaps I didn't make myself clear.  I don't like you...}{Perhaps I didn't make myself clear.  I don't like you...}{}{19}{}{ }
{11005}{It's been a while since we've seen this magickal affliction!  You'll draw some laughs here in Qintarra...}{It's been a while since we've seen this magickal affliction!  You'll draw some laughs here in Qintarra...}{}{20}{}{ }
{12016}{I'm sorry.  But I'd never follow someone as evil as you are...}{I'm sorry.  But I'd never follow someone as evil as you are...}{}{21}{}{ }
{12017}{No.  I'm afraid I just don't like you very much...}{No.  I'm afraid I just don't like you very much...}{}{22}{}{ }
{12018}{Goodbye.  I hope we see one another again...}{Goodbye.  I hope we see one another again...}{}{23}{}{ }
{12019}{Good bye and good riddance to you...}{Good bye and good riddance to you...}{}{24}{}{ }
{12020}{Of course.  I'll do that right away.}{Of course.  I'll do that right away.}{}{25}{}{ }
{12021}{No, I won't do that...}{No, I won't do that...}{}{26}{}{ }
{12022}{Ouch!  Be careful!  I'm on your side, remember...?}{Ouch!  Be careful!  I'm on your side, remember...?}{}{27}{}{ }
{12023}{I've never seen such a skillful blow!}{I've never seen such a skillful blow!}{}{28}{}{ }
{12024}{Hmmm.  Perhaps combat isn't your strong point...}{Hmmm.  Perhaps combat isn't your strong point...}{}{29}{}{ }
{12026}{No.  You already have too many companions as it is...}{No.  You already have too many companions as it is...}{}{30}{}{ }
{12027}{Sorry, but you seem to be lacking leadership qualities...}{Sorry, but you seem to be lacking leadership qualities...}{}{31}{}{ }
{12028}{I'm sorry, but I think you'll need to see some more of the world before I join you...}{I'm sorry, but I think you'll need to see some more of the world before I join you...}{}{32}{}{ }
{12029}{Ahh!  Leave me alone!}{Ahh!  Leave me alone!}{}{33}{}{ }
{12046}{Excuse me, but perhaps you'd let me do that?}{Excuse me, but perhaps you'd let me do that?}{}{34}{}{ }
{12047}{Don't do that!  We mustn't fight amongst ourselves!}{Don't do that!  We mustn't fight amongst ourselves!}{}{35}{}{ }
{12048}{I can't believe you'd have me attack such a good-hearted person!}{I can't believe you'd have me attack such a good-hearted person!}{}{36}{}{ }
{12049}{Don't!  This person is from Qintarra!  I demand you stop right now!}{Don't!  This person is from Qintarra!  I demand you stop right now!}{}{37}{}{ }
{12050}{No!  This person is my friend!  You must stop this right away!}{No!  This person is my friend!  You must stop this right away!}{}{38}{}{ }
{12052}{Excuse me, but if you continue on this evil path, then I will be forced to leave you.  Perhaps you're not the person I thought you were...}{Excuse me, but if you continue on this evil path, then I will be forced to leave you.  Perhaps you're not the person I thought you were...}{}{39}{}{ }
{12053}{I hate to say this, but I find myself liking you less and less.  If this continues, I'm afraid I'll be leaving...}{I hate to say this, but I find myself liking you less and less.  If this continues, I'm afraid I'll be leaving...}{}{40}{}{ }
{12054}{Ahh!  I've been badly wounded!  Please, my friend...I need healing...}{Ahh!  I've been badly wounded!  Please, my friend...I need healing...}{}{41}{}{ }

